  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-039">All five actions dispatch via PaneEventBus → ConversationPane → dispatchConsumer → POST /api/ai/chat/sessions/{id}/dispatch → SessionDispatchOrchestrator → GetBindingByIdAsync → prompted executor. Dispatch code adds ZERO new routes; NO string-key resolution outside the Binding table. §7.2 is the binding reviewer guard — a code-review checklist item enforces it.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-040">The `workspace.compose_assistant_insert` apply event references the ledger entry (its `ledgerRef` field); it NEVER carries the edit payload as the source of truth. Storage precedes rendering; the Workspace materializes from the ledger.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-030">The PaneEventBus discriminant union is CLOSED and stays untouched — add ZERO new discriminants. Use only the EXISTING `compose_selection_offer` (conversation) + `compose_assistant_insert` (workspace) from compose-contracts.ts. The dispatch trigger is a direct `dispatchConsumer` call, NOT a bus event.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-028">Client fetches use @spaarke/auth, never raw Bearer.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-021">Any UI touched (toolbar, streamed message) is Fluent v9 + dark mode.</constraint>
  </constraints>

